{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A01", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC must give the borrower a cooling‑off period of at least one day.", "citations": ["D16_A_0016"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002079, "gen_latency_s": 1.6400214999957825, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2756, "output_tokens": 100, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002079, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0015", "D16_A_0014"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.10569589999795426, "total_latency_s": 1.74583249999705, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A02", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "If data is processed outside India, it must be deleted from those foreign servers and returned to India within 24 hours of processing.", "citations": ["D16_A_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022544999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.079134300001897, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2766, "output_tokens": 124, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00022545, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0019", "D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0021", "D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0017"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.09119690000079572, "total_latency_s": 1.1704570000001695, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A03", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The cap on Default Loss Guarantee (DLG) cover for a digital‑lending portfolio is five per cent (5%) of the total amount disbursed from that portfolio at any given time.", "citations": ["D16_A_0024", "D16_A_0025"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00024855, "gen_latency_s": 0.9372065999996266, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2814, "output_tokens": 125, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00024855, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0025", "D16_A_0024", "D16_A_0026", "D16_A_0004", "D16_A_0023"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.11135279999871273, "total_latency_s": 1.048676099999284, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A04", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC must report the digital lending apps it uses on the Centralised Information Management System (CIMS) portal of the Reserve Bank.", "citations": ["D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0021"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002196, "gen_latency_s": 2.538892399999895, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2804, "output_tokens": 95, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002196, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0021", "D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0013", "D16_A_0017", "D16_A_0019"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.07863869999710005, "total_latency_s": 2.617643000005046, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A05", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "When an LSP works with multiple lenders, it must provide the borrower with a digital view that displays the name(s) of each lender offering the loan, the loan amount, tenor, APR, monthly repayment obligation, and any penal charges. It must also supply a link to the KFS for each lender and disclose the names of any unmatched lenders.", "citations": ["D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0011"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00024765000000000003, "gen_latency_s": 1.215185000000929, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2766, "output_tokens": 198, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00024765, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0011", "D16_A_0014", "D16_A_0005", "D16_A_0018"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04231459999573417, "total_latency_s": 1.2576131999958307, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A06", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Yes. Under the current RBI directions, an NBFC may retain a reasonable one‑time processing fee if a borrower exits a digital loan during the cooling‑off period, provided that the fee is disclosed upfront in the KFS.", "citations": ["D16_A_0016"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000233775, "gen_latency_s": 1.1871526000031736, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2733, "output_tokens": 160, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000233775, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0015", "D16_A_0014", "D16_A_0017", "D16_A_0018"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04521979999844916, "total_latency_s": 1.2324684000050183, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A07", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No.  An NBFC’s digital lending app or its lending service provider must not access mobile‑phone resources such as files, media, contact lists, call logs or telephony functions. A one‑time access is permitted only for camera, microphone, location or other facilities that are strictly necessary for onboarding or KYC, with explicit consent.", "citations": ["D16_A_0018"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000244425, "gen_latency_s": 1.1145532000009553, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2763, "output_tokens": 188, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000244425, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0017", "D16_A_0014", "D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0012"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03992110000399407, "total_latency_s": 1.1545799000014085, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A08", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "If an NBFC or its linked LSP does not respond within 30 days of receiving a complaint, the borrower may lodge a complaint through the Reserve Bank’s Complaint Management System (CMS) portal under the Reserve Bank‑Integrated Ombudsman Scheme or send a physical complaint to the Centralised Receipt and Processing Centre, 4th Floor, Reserve Bank of India, Sector‑17, Central Vista, Chandigarh – 160017.", "citations": ["D16_A_0017"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00024802499999999997, "gen_latency_s": 1.2066475000028731, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2743, "output_tokens": 141, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000248025, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0017", "D16_A_0014", "D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0021"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.041279800003394485, "total_latency_s": 1.248035800002981, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A09", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A new payment aggregator must have a minimum net‑worth of ₹15 crore when applying for RBI authorisation, and must achieve a net‑worth of ₹25 crore by the end of the third financial year after the grant of authorisation.", "citations": ["D06_A_0005"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000255825, "gen_latency_s": 1.0009552000046824, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2807, "output_tokens": 151, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000255825, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0005", "D13_A_0006", "D06_A_0004", "D06_A_0006", "D06_A_0003"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03921990000526421, "total_latency_s": 1.0402755000031902, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A10", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An entity carrying on only PA‑P business must apply for authorisation by December 31, 2025.  If it fails to apply by that date, it must inform its banker(s) immediately and wind up its business by February 28, 2026.", "citations": ["D06_A_0004"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002487, "gen_latency_s": 1.4790454000030877, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2796, "output_tokens": 194, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002487, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0004", "D06_A_0002", "D06_A_0005", "D06_A_0017", "D06_A_0003"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0501873000030173, "total_latency_s": 1.5293387999990955, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A11", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A non‑bank payment aggregator must keep the funds it collects on behalf of its merchants in a separate escrow account held with any Scheduled Commercial Bank (SCB) in India.", "citations": ["D06_A_0014"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022417500000000001, "gen_latency_s": 1.4544049000032828, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2753, "output_tokens": 123, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000224175, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0003", "D06_A_0014", "D06_A_0002", "D06_A_0013", "D11_A_0029"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04812810000294121, "total_latency_s": 1.5026505999994697, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A12", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "Existing Payment Aggregators (PAs) had to achieve a net‑worth of ₹15 crore by March 31, 2021 and a net‑worth of ₹25 crore by March 31, 2023.", "citations": ["D05_A_0003"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002427, "gen_latency_s": 1.4004283000031137, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2920, "output_tokens": 143, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002427, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D05_A_0003", "D06_A_0005", "D05_A_0004", "D05_A_0005", "D05_A_0000"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.05215499999758322, "total_latency_s": 1.4526809000017238, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A13", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "For digital payments other than card‑present transactions, at least one of the authentication factors must be dynamically created or proven – that is, the proof of possession of the factor, being sent as part of the transaction, must be unique to that transaction.", "citations": ["D10_A_0002"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022845, "gen_latency_s": 1.2402077000006102, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2730, "output_tokens": 143, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00022845, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0002", "D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0006", "D09_A_0001", "D09_A_0000"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.05225590000191005, "total_latency_s": 1.2925646000003326, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A14", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Payment system providers must comply with the RBI's Authentication Mechanisms Directions, 2025 by April 01, 2026.", "citations": ["D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0001"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022994999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.2531297000023187, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2862, "output_tokens": 115, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00022995, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0001", "D10_A_0002", "D09_A_0000", "D10_A_0005"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.040991800000483636, "total_latency_s": 1.2942116000049282, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A15", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The directions require that the two authentication factors be independent so that compromise of one factor does not affect the reliability of the other.", "citations": ["D10_A_0002"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00024855, "gen_latency_s": 1.168747900002927, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2866, "output_tokens": 112, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00024855, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0002", "D09_A_0001", "D10_A_0000", "D13_A_0016", "D10_A_0001"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03564589999587042, "total_latency_s": 1.2044839000009233, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
