{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A17", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The minimum validity period of a Prepaid Payment Instrument (PPI) is one year from the date of last loading/reloading in the PPI.", "citations": ["D11_A_0032"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00021464999999999999, "gen_latency_s": 1.0240857000026153, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2690, "output_tokens": 107, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00021465, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_A_0032", "D11_A_0033", "D11_A_0005", "D11_A_0036", "D11_A_0031"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03356580000399845, "total_latency_s": 1.0577401999980793, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A18", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The amount outstanding for a full‑KYC Prepaid Payment Instrument (PPI) shall not exceed Rs.2,00,000 at any point of time.", "citations": ["D11_A_0018"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022642500000000001, "gen_latency_s": 0.9101569999984349, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2803, "output_tokens": 118, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000226425, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_A_0018", "D11_A_0016", "D11_A_0020", "D11_A_0017", "D11_A_0019"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03935700000147335, "total_latency_s": 0.9496117000016966, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A19", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No. Small PPIs issued under RBI’s Master Directions are restricted to the purchase of goods and services only; cash withdrawal or funds transfer from such PPIs is not permitted.", "citations": ["D11_A_0003", "D11_A_0017"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002598, "gen_latency_s": 1.1045602999947732, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2808, "output_tokens": 164, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002598, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_A_0017", "D11_A_0016", "D11_A_0003", "D11_A_0019", "D11_A_0020"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03575339999952121, "total_latency_s": 1.1404234000001452, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.3333333333333333, "first_hit_rank": 3, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A20", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC‑Account Aggregator must have a minimum net owned fund of rupees two crore.", "citations": ["D13_A_0006"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000225825, "gen_latency_s": 1.2373076000003493, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2855, "output_tokens": 103, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000225825, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D13_A_0006", "D13_A_0007", "D16_A_0023", "D13_A_0005", "D13_A_0012"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03700830000161659, "total_latency_s": 1.2744168999997783, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A21", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No, an Account Aggregator (NBFC‑AA) is not permitted to process payment transactions for its customers. The RBI directions state that an NBFC‑AA shall not support transactions by customers and is limited to the business of account aggregation only.", "citations": ["D13_A_0009"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000236175, "gen_latency_s": 1.1193287000060081, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2821, "output_tokens": 146, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000236175, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0002", "D13_A_0012", "D13_A_0009", "D14_A_0023", "D06_A_0003"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04820070000278065, "total_latency_s": 1.1676291999974637, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.3333333333333333, "first_hit_rank": 3, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A22", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The consent obtained by an NBFC‑AA must be a standardised consent artefact that contains the following details:\n1. identity of the customer and optional contact information;\n2. the nature of the financial information requested;\n3. purpose of collecting such information;\n4. the identity of the recipients of the information, if any;\n5. URL or other address to which notification needs to be sent every time the consent artefact is used to access information;\n6. consent creation date, expiry date, identity and signature/digital signature of the NBFC‑AA;\n7. any other attribute as may be prescribed by the Reserve Bank. The artefact may also be obtained in electronic form.\n", "citations": ["D13_A_0010"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000255825, "gen_latency_s": 1.8614553000006708, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2763, "output_tokens": 226, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000255825, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D13_A_0012", "D13_A_0010", "D13_A_0011", "D13_A_0009", "D13_A_0008"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.08832019999681506, "total_latency_s": 1.9499194000018178, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
